# Scheduled data collection for the Hyperliquid agent.
#
# Install with:
#   crontab /home/jaiiye/CodeBuddy/20260913183734/scripts/collect.cron
#
# Check accumulated progress with:
#   /home/jaiiye/CodeBuddy/20260913183734/scripts/collect.sh --summary
#
# Every 15 minutes. Measured cost per pass:
#   * ~95 wallet position reads for snapshots + ~95 for the cycle
#   * the 37 MB leaderboard at most once per 6h (wallet cache TTL)
#   * ~150s wall time, so the duty cycle is roughly 17%
#
# The script holds an exclusive lock, so a run that overruns the interval
# causes the next invocation to exit immediately rather than stack up.

SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin
MAILTO=""

# min hour day month weekday   command
*/15 * * * * /home/jaiiye/CodeBuddy/20260913183734/scripts/collect.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
